  "96": "table7.dat     82      687   Table of radial profiles",
  "163": "Byte-by-byte Description of file: table7.dat",
  "165": "   Bytes Format Units             Label    Explanations",
  "171": "  20- 24  F5.2 Msun/pc2           SigmaHI  ? Surface density of H I (2)",
  "172": "  26- 28  F3.1 Msun/pc2         e_SigmaHI  rms uncertainty in SigmaHI (3)",
  "173": "  30- 35  F6.2 Msun/pc2           SigmaH2  ? Surface density of H2 (2)",
  "174": "  37- 40  F4.1 Msun/pc2         e_SigmaH2  ? RMS uncertainty in SigmaH2",
  "175": "  42- 48  F7.1 Msun/pc2           Sigma*   Surface density of stars",
  "176": "  50- 54  F5.1 Msun/pc2         e_Sigma*   rms uncertainty in Sigma* (3)",
  "179": "  64- 68  F5.1 10-4Msun/yr/kpc2 e_FUV+24   rms uncertainty in FUV+24",
  "185": "Note (2): Including helium.",
  "186": "Note (3): 1.0 = upper limit.",
  "190": "    From electronic version of the journal",
  "196": "  follows the rules of the Standard Description for Astronomical Catalogues;"
 },
